tags: ["hindi"]
---

{title: Ye Teri Aankhen Jhuki Jhuki}
{artist: Abhijeet Jatin Lalit}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Yeh Teri Aankhen Jhuki Jhuki,
[Am]Yeh Tera Chehra Khila Khila
[G]Badi Kismatwala Hai Woh,
[F]Pyar Tera [Am]Jise Mila
[Am]Yeh Teri Aankhen Jhuki Jhuki
[Am]Chhalakti Gaalon Se Laali,
[Am]Badi Tu Sharm-O-Haya Waali
[G]Honth Tere Pooja Ke Phool,
[F]Phool Ki [Am]Naazuk Tu Daali
[Am]Yeh Teri Aankhen Jhuki Jhuki
[Am]Kisi Ke Pyaare Pyaare Baal,
[Am]Kisi Ki Pyaari Pyaari Chaal
[G]Tu Sar Se Paaon Talak Sundar,
[F]Tu Hai Kudrat [Am]Ka Koi Kamaal
[Am]Yeh Teri Aankhen Jhuki Jhuki
